{"game": "warframe", "language": "english", "appid": 230410, "month": "2020-06", "window": 3, "start_date": 1592265600, "end_date": 1592870399, "month_true_total": 2300, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-14 19:00:34 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "71198902", "author": {"steamid": "76561198018063850", "personaname": "Neytiri", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Neytiriii/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 15343, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 14671, "last_played": 1752596409, "avatar": "6ad01dde23e2fc77fae177ed135d24614afdb87b"}, "language": "english", "review": "it'd be better with more than 1 - 2 people playing with you at a time.", "timestamp_created": 1592869251, "timestamp_updated": 1592869251, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "71198433", "author": {"steamid": "76561197961146500", "personaname": "SerNub", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197961146500/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 260795, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 236834, "last_played": 1747009903, "avatar": "72fa170f933a1838b16f6ba2854abd4d8fb1e618"}, "language": "english", "review": "There's something about the fluidity of movement in this game that keeps me coming back, the frames and weapons are varied and interesting, the lore and events a constant work of development, the engine always being tuned, but the actual whooshing about is the clincher.\n\nI mean, there's much to do, so much different content to engage with aside from the regular missions and quests, there is a ton of stuff you can do over and again or just largely ignore once you have what you want from it.  Bouncy space ninja does what they want\n\nYes, there is a bit of a grindy element (people don't call it Warfarm for no reason) and some of the % chances of drops you might be chasing will be a bit \"WHY?!\" BUT the game is an MMO, designed to be played over time, best enjoyed with others, and the various mechanics promote that.  You can always spend platinum (which you can get by trading to players) on boosters if you want to speed things along a bit.\n\nThe community is great, helpful and usually willing to take time to explain stuff to anyone.  \"We all had help at the start... pay it on\" I guess?\n\nDid I mention it's really pretty? \n\nIn closing, it's pretty, the community is fantastic and it's fundamentally fun to play.   I might need to spend a little more time on it before I can write a proper review though.", "timestamp_created": 1592868331, "timestamp_updated": 1592868331, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "71198377", "author": {"steamid": "76561198987918971", "personaname": "Lumin", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/LuminGlows/", "num_games_owned": 66, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 92457, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 24, "playtime_at_review": 26695, "last_played": 1789250489, "avatar": "274d3de3abaf67307e4ec64a409430c6b2ec4b9e"}, "language": "english", "review": "game gud\n", "timestamp_created": 1592868226, "timestamp_updated": 1592868226, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false